msgid "fail2ban"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings.php:317
msgid "Destination"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings.php:321
msgid "Trusted proxies"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings.php:336
msgid "IP addresses or ranges (CIDR) of the reverse proxies or CDN in front of the site, one per line. Only requests that come from one of them are allowed to name the visitor's address in X-Forwarded-For. Leave it empty if the site is reached directly: trusting that header from anyone would let anyone get any address banned."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings.php:348
msgid "Write a test line"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings.php:349
msgid "Writes \"Login Hardening test line\" to the destination above, even if logging is off, to check that it arrives. No filter counts it."
msgstr ""

